Optional Epic Games content (City Sample, MetaHuman, Marketplace/Fab/Megascans,
KitBash3D, Poliigon, etc.) is NOT bundled in this repository. Users who want to
enable optional Epic content must download it through their own Epic / Fab
accounts and run the integration setup scripts under tools/content_release/.
See CITYSAMPLE_METAHUMAN_OPTIONAL_INTEGRATION.md for details.

The repository contains C++ source files derived from Unreal Engine project
templates. Those files retain Epic Games' template copyright header in
addition to the MIT grant above; this is the standard Unreal Engine source
template practice and does not relicense Epic's engine code.
